OL,3,GNEWSAHow afternoon tea has helped bring
OL,4,Acommunities together
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust 11 miles separate the small
OL,7,Fvillage of Skeffington from the
OL,8,Fbustling streets of Leicester's Golden
OL,9,FMile.
OL,11,FDespite the short distance, many
OL,12,Fresidents have had little opportunity
OL,13,Fto meet.
OL,15,FNow, reciprocal invitations for
OL,16,Fafternoon tea have helped to build new
OL,17,Ffriendships as part of an exchange
OL,18,Fscheme connecting rural Leicestershire
OL,19,Fchurches to Hindu, Muslim and Sikh
OL,20,Fcommunities in the city.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
