OL,3,GNEWSAHow afternoon tea has helped bring
OL,4,Acommunities together
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme is organised by the St
OL,7,FPhilip's Centre, which was set up 20
OL,8,Fyears ago to build bridges between
OL,9,Fcommunities in Leicestershire.
